# Claws rival. Rholont beside Claws of the Griffon (available: Gifts of the Griffon completed, a GM; its 47 is a
# Progress reply and the quest-specific replies below tie or beat it; a tie takes container order the first time,
# and the rotation var is written only once two or more replies tie, so a later tie plays the next reply) and
# Songbirds in a Snowstorm (a Lua quest). A level 99 Warrior in Southern San d'Oria [S]. Each state is set by GMs;
# after a talk Claws is set back to available (a GM) so it stays a rival; every talk is followed by its finish.
